    "display_name": "Is AI always right? ",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Investigate how AI-generated explanations about health and wellness can feel trustworthy, and where that confidence breaks down.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://images.code.org/5c326440496997bf28f5f2297bc989dc-energy-drink.png",
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "#Step 1: Ask It.\r\nAsk the AI your health and energy drink questions.\r\n\r\nStart simple. Then keep going.\r\n- Do energy drinks improve focus for middle school students?\r\n\r\n- Are energy drinks safe for teens?\r\n\r\n#Step 2: Stress Test It.\r\nStress test the AI bot to see if it's telling the truth.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n- Ask clarifying questions: Are there any side effects?\r\n\r\n- Push for specifics: Can you name a specific study?\r\n\r\n- Demand sources or proof: What research supports that?\r\n\r\n**Reminder: Your job isn’t to argue. Your job is to test how strong the answer really is.**",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
